      "meaning": "The procession now suits its bridegroom, and many wonders occur along the road. Meanwhile Himālaya raises an indescribably marvelous pavilion and invites every mountain in the world, great and small, along with forests, oceans, rivers and lakes. Assuming beautiful forms, all come to the snow mountain’s home with their communities, sons and wives, singing loving auspicious songs. Himālaya has many dwellings prepared and lodges each guest suitably. The city’s delightful splendor makes even Brahmā’s skill seem slight.",
